# DDD and ADRs

- Recommendations must cite **evidence** (metrics, traces, co-change, data ownership)
- ADRs include: context name, services grouped, why together, why not separate, risks
- Flag **false cohesion** when naming overlaps but data/traffic does not
- Confidence scores must reference specific evidence bullets
